# cabin_lit_bank_r: the right bank of three tall windows lit from inside at
# night (decision 38), its own room, so the two banks never mirror: a table
# lamp on its table in the pane by the door (its shade warm, its stand
# dark), a bookshelf in the middle pane (dark shelves, warm spines), a
# high-backed chair dark in the far pane with the floor lit warm round it.
# The anchor, 0,0, is at_win_right, the bank's top right corner.
